hscript-seiun
=============

Merged HaxeScript runtime for SeiunEngine.

This library is a derivative work combining the following MIT-licensed
projects (license texts are kept in LICENSE):

- hscript (Haxe Foundation, (C)2008-2017)
  https://github.com/HaxeFoundation/hscript
  Base parser/interpreter (Expr, Parser, Interp, Printer, Bytes, ...).

- hscript-iris (crowplexus, Ne_Eo)
  https://github.com/crowplexus/hscript-iris
  Base packages `hscript` / `hscript.iris`: imports and
  aliases, finals, enums, typedefs, packages, `using`, improved error
  handling and for-loop optimizations.

- hscript-improved (FNF-CNE-Devs)
  https://github.com/FNF-CNE-Devs/hscript-improved
  Script-class runtime (CustomClassHandler, IHScriptCustomBehaviour,
  IHScriptCustomConstructor), `_HSX` / `_HSC` shadow-class build macros
  (macros/ClassExtendMacro.hx, UsingHandler.hx, Utils.hx), plus
  scriptObject, static/public variables, import callbacks and redirects
  merged into Interp.

- hscript-plus (Dlean Jeans, (C)2017)
  https://github.com/DleanJeans/hscript-plus
  Script-to-script class inheritance via Dynamic `super` chains
  (DynamicClass.hx, access-modifier parsing).

No code from FNF Codename Engine (Apache-2.0) is included; this library is
built entirely from the MIT-licensed hscript forks listed above.
